Date: Mon, 20 Apr 2026 10:44:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 0007] Complete model_table refactor and add JSON model config system

Phase 1 (Patch 0007): Finish migrating BasicVSR, TSENet, VideoProc, CustVSR, EDSR
branches into the model_table[] descriptor. Write pack_input_basicvsr/tsenet and
unpack_output_basicvsr. Add 4 new ModelDesc fields to replace hardcoded if/else
chains in 4 hot-path functions.

Phase 2 (Patch 0008): Add WindowType enum, normalize_input/normalize_output fields,
model_config AVOption, CUSTOM=-1 sentinel, ModelDesc *dynamic_desc in IVSRModel,
parse_model_config_json(), pack_input_window(), unpack_output_generic_fp32(),
free_dynamic_desc(), and get_model_desc() helper. New models can now be registered
via a JSON file without any C changes.

